				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-27T11:13:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="mori:W00269"
				Time="2011-10-27T04:27:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>監督「オイ！　新人！
オマエは　まず　台本を▽
なめるように　読んどけっ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-10-27T11:13:48" />
